Implemented the deploy-request detail fix so GitHub App state is no longer inferred from stale repo-level failure text.

Changes:
- Added a shared GitHub App status helper at [repo-status.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-047/src/lib/github-app/repo-status.ts) and a small status endpoint at [route.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-047/src/app/api/v1/github-app/repos/status/route.ts).
- Updated merge-readiness handling at [route.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-047/src/app/api/v1/deploy-requests/[requestId]/merge-readiness/route.ts) to distinguish:
  - `not_installed` -> keep `GitHub App not installed on this repo (...)`
  - `setup_incomplete` -> `Setup incomplete — configure workflow and API key`
